ormable porous media with heat transfer</span>. <abbr class="cit-jnl-abbrev">Transp. Porous Media</abbr> <span class="cit-vol">114</span>, <span class="cit-fpage">525</span>–<span class="cit-lpage">556</span> (<span class="cit-pub-date">2016</span>).</cite></div><div class="cit-extra"><a href="{openurl}?query=rft.jtitle%253DTransp.%2BPorous%2BMedia%26rft.volume%253D114%26rft.spage%253D525%26rft.genre%253Darticle%26rft_val_fmt%253Dinfo%253Aofi%252Ffmt%253Akev%253Amtx%253Ajournal%26ctx_ver%253DZ39.88-2004%26url_ver%253DZ39.88-2004%26url_ctx_fmt%253Dinfo%253Aofi%252Ffmt%253Akev%253Amtx%253Actx" class="cit-ref-sprinkles cit-ref-sprinkles-openurl cit-ref-sprinkles-open-url"><span>OpenUrl</span></a></div></div></li><li><a class="rev-xref-ref" href="#xref-ref-4-1" title="View reference 4 in text" id="ref-4">↵</a><div class="cit ref-cit ref-journal" id="cit-118.17.e2024069118.4"><div class="cit-metadata"><ol class="cit-auth-list"><li><span class="cit-auth"> <span class="cit-name-given-names">Y. C.</span> <span class="cit-name-surname">Yortsos</span></span>, </li><li><span class="cit-auth"> <span class="cit-name-given-names">A. K.</span> <span class="cit-name-surname">Stubos</span></span></li></ol><cite>, <span class="cit-article-title">Phase change in porous media</span>. <abbr class="cit-jnl-abbrev">Curr. Opin. Colloid Interface Sci.</abbr> <span class="cit-vol">6</span>, <span class="cit-fpage">208</span>–<span class="cit-lpage">216</span> (<span class="cit-pub-date">2001</span>).</cite></div><div class="cit-extra"><a href="{openurl}?query=rft.jtitle%253DCurr.%2BOpin.%2BColloid%2BInterface%2BSci.%26rft.volume%253D6%26rft.spage%253D208%26rft.genre%253Darticle%26rft_val_fmt%253Dinfo%253Aofi%252Ffmt%253Akev%253Amtx%253Ajournal%26ctx_ver%253DZ39.88-2004%26url_ver%253DZ39.88-2004%26url_ctx_fmt%253Dinfo%253Aofi%252Ffmt%253Akev%253Amtx%253Actx" class="cit-ref-sprinkles cit-ref-sprinkles-openurl cit-ref-sprinkles-open-url"><span>OpenUrl</span></a></div></div></li><li><a class="re