%2Ba%2Bnarrow%2Bcapillary.%26rft_id%253Dinfo%253Apmid%252F14554190%26rft.genre%253Darticle%26rft_val_fmt%253Dinfo%253Aofi%252Ffmt%253Akev%253Amtx%253Ajournal%26ctx_ver%253DZ39.88-2004%26url_ver%253DZ39.88-2004%26url_ctx_fmt%253Dinfo%253Aofi%252Ffmt%253Akev%253Amtx%253Actx" class="cit-ref-sprinkles cit-ref-sprinkles-openurl cit-ref-sprinkles-open-url"><span>OpenUrl</span></a><a href="/lookup/external-ref?access_num=14554190&amp;link_type=MED&amp;atom=%2Fpnas%2F118%2F17%2Fe2024069118.atom" class="cit-ref-sprinkles cit-ref-sprinkles-medline"><span>PubMed</span></a></div></div></li><li><a class="rev-xref-ref" href="#xref-ref-8-1" title="View reference 8 in text" id="ref-8">↵</a><div class="cit ref-cit ref-journal" id="cit-118.17.e2024069118.8"><div class="cit-metadata"><ol class="cit-auth-list"><li><span class="cit-auth"> <span class="cit-name-given-names">B.</span> <span class="cit-name-surname">Géraud</span></span>, </li><li><span class="cit-auth"> <span class="cit-name-given-names">S. A.</span> <span class="cit-name-surname">Jones</span></span>, </li><li><span class="cit-auth"> <span class="cit-name-given-names">I.</span> <span class="cit-name-surname">Cantat</span></span>, </li><li><span class="cit-auth"> <span class="cit-name-given-names">B.</span> <span class="cit-name-surname">Dollet</span></span>, </li><li><span class="cit-auth"> <span class="cit-name-given-names">Y.</span> <span class="cit-name-surname">Méheust</span></span></li></ol><cite>, <span class="cit-article-title">The flow of a foam in a two-dimensional porous medium</span>. <abbr class="cit-jnl-abbrev">Water Resour. Res.</abbr> <span class="cit-vol">52</span>, <span class="cit-fpage">773</span>–<span class="cit-lpage">790</span> (<span class="cit-pub-date">2016</span>).</cite></div><div class="cit-extra"><a href="{openurl}?query=rft.jtitle%253DWater%2BResour.%2BRes.%26rft.volume%253D52%26rft.spage%253D773%26rft.genre%253Darticle%26rft_val_fmt%253Dinfo%253Aofi%252Ffmt%253Akev%253Amtx%253Ajournal%26ctx_